    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d780">

                <pb facs="0752" n="636" xml:id="pg636"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.51/639.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Kuhn, Loeb and Company to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-06">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 6, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>We have the honor to acknowledge receipt of your telegram in reference to Liberia
                    and we shall at once take up the question which you bring to our attention with
                    the fiscal agency and the attorneys and advise you as promptly as possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kuhn, Loeb and Company.</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
